-- Worldwide Handyman — generated SEO landing page content
--
-- 50 location pages, 26 service pages, 120 service x city pages.
-- Requires the seo_* tables to exist (sql/seo.sql or sql/schema.sql).
--
--   /Applications/XAMPP/xamppfiles/bin/mysql -u root --host=127.0.0.1 < sql/seo-seed.sql
--
-- Re-importing replaces all landing page content. Anything edited in
-- Admin -> SEO will be overwritten, so export first if you have made changes.

